  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of Historic Monuments in Kruje Damaged by the November 2019 Albania Earthquake, Analysis and Treatment of Bedrock</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the process of stabilizing and restoring the clock tower at Kruje Fortress following the November 2019 Albania, Earthquake, the project team discovered fractures in the bedrock beneath the tower foundations. This project involves the investigation of the fracutures in depth and the development of a detailed intervention approach for strengthening the rock beneath the tower.</narrative>
  </description>
